 │     PID  S     NI        CPU%▼        MEM%     RSS  COMMAND                           ││ RSS — resident set size                                 │
 │     201  Z      0          0.0         0.0      0B  <defunct> (defunct)               ││                                                         │
 │     200  R     10          0.0  ▋      3.1    512M  cpuhog --threads 2                ││ ● PID 201 (defunct): 0B (0 bytes)                       │
 │     100  S      0          0.0  ▏      0.0    4.0M  -bash                             ││                                                         │
 │       1  S      0          0.0  ▏      0.0    4.0M  init                              ││ How much of the process's memory is in RAM right now.   │
 │                                                                                       ││ It counts private pages and shared pages (libraries,    │
 │                                                                                       ││ shared memory), and the shared pages are counted in     │
 │                                                                                       ││ full for every process that maps them. So the RSS of    │
 │                                                                                       ││ all processes added together can far exceed physical    │
 │                                                                                       ││ RAM.                                                    │
 │                                                                                       ││                                                         │
 │                                                                                       ││ Linux VmRSS: in /proc/<pid>/status, which is RssAnon +  │
 │                                                                                       ││ RssFile + RssShmem. Field 24 of stat gives the same     │
 │                                                                                       ││ value in pages.                                         │
 │                                                                                       ││ macOS proc_taskinfo.pti_resident_size. Activity Monitor │
 │                                                                                       ││ prefers 'footprint' (see phys_footprint).  ◆ this       │
 │                                                                                       ││ machine                                                 │
 │                                                                                       ││                                                         │
 │                                                                                       ││ Watch out                                               │
 │                                                                                       ││ ! RSS double-counts shared libraries. For 'how much     │
 │                                                                                       ││ would I free by killing this?', look at USS. For a fair │
 │                                                                                       ││ share, look at PSS.                                     │
